WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.480 --> 00:00:06.800
Hi, mystery recapped here. Today I'm going&nbsp;
to explain the horror thriller film called&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:06.800 --> 00:00:16.080
30 Days Of Night . Spoilers ahead.&nbsp;
Watch out and take care          
&nbsp;

00:00:16.080 --> 00:00:21.200
The movie starts with a filthy-looking man&nbsp;
dressed in a furry coat staring at a ship&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:21.200 --> 00:00:26.400
harboring to the shore. It's wintertime&nbsp;
in Barrow, Alaska. Everyone in the town&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:26.400 --> 00:00:31.680
is preparing for the upcoming polar night, a&nbsp;
month-long period where the sun doesn't rise.
&nbsp;

00:00:31.680 --> 00:00:38.000
It is the last day before 30 long days of&nbsp;
complete darkness begins. Barrow's sheriffs,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:38.000 --> 00:00:44.320
Eben Oleson, and Billy Kitka are examining a&nbsp;
pile of burnt satellite phones in the snow.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:44.320 --> 00:00:49.920
As a result, the town doesn't have access to&nbsp;
communication with the outside world. Most people&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:49.920 --> 00:00:55.200
in the town are leaving to avoid the thirty days&nbsp;
of isolation while others are preparing for it.
&nbsp;

00:00:59.520 --> 00:01:04.080
At a local dog kennel, someone&nbsp;
gruesomely stabs all the dogs to death.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:04.080 --> 00:01:09.600
Eben gets informed about the situation and he&nbsp;
agrees to check it out. Eben’s wife Stella works&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:09.600 --> 00:01:14.720
for Alaska's fire department. She is in the town&nbsp;
for the day but hasn’t told Eben because they&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:14.720 --> 00:01:20.000
are not on good terms. However, on her way to&nbsp;
catch a flight home, she gets into an accident&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:20.000 --> 00:01:26.560
so she calls Eben for help. However, Eben&nbsp;
replies that he is busy and sends Billy instead.
&nbsp;

00:01:26.560 --> 00:01:32.080
At the kennel, as Eben examines the dead dogs, he&nbsp;
notices that the dogs were stabbed repeatedly and&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:32.080 --> 00:01:36.960
mutilated. He then reassures the owner&nbsp;
John Riis that they will find the culprit.
&nbsp;

00:01:36.960 --> 00:01:42.160
Meanwhile, Billy drives Stella to the airport&nbsp;
as fast as possible, but the flight has already&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:42.160 --> 00:01:48.320
taken off, and the airport is closed. She is&nbsp;
now stuck in the town for the next 30 days too.
&nbsp;

00:01:48.320 --> 00:01:51.440
Eben goes to the police station,&nbsp;
where he meets his little brother&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:51.440 --> 00:01:57.120
Jake Oleson and his grandmother, Helen Munson,&nbsp;
who works in the station as well. She informs&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:57.120 --> 00:02:03.040
him about a vandalism problem at the Utilidor. As&nbsp;
Eben reaches Utilidor, he meets his friends Carter&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:03.040 --> 00:02:07.840
and Wilson. He finds out that someone has&nbsp;
destroyed Wilson’s helicopter. Eben quickly&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:07.840 --> 00:02:12.960
realizes that someone is trying to cut off every&nbsp;
means of communication with the outside world.
&nbsp;

00:02:12.960 --> 00:02:17.920
Elsewhere, the town’s electrical manager&nbsp;
Gus is busy working at his station when he&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:17.920 --> 00:02:22.720
hears noises from outside. As he steps&nbsp;
outside to investigate with his torch,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:22.720 --> 00:02:28.960
he is surrounded by several mysterious figures. He&nbsp;
tries to run away but gets attacked. The strangers&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:28.960 --> 00:02:34.880
slowly kill him while sucking his blood. It is&nbsp;
then revealed that the strangers are vampires,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:34.880 --> 00:02:40.960
who plan to feast on Barrow for the next 30 days!
The man from the beginning of the movie is in a&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:40.960 --> 00:02:46.560
diner asking for raw meat and alcohol. When the&nbsp;
waitress denies his requests, he tries to attack&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:46.560 --> 00:02:52.560
her. Eben and Stella are there too. As Eben tries&nbsp;
to stop the man, he gets progressively violent,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:52.560 --> 00:02:58.480
so he arrests him. Eben along with Stella then&nbsp;
take the man to the station and lock him up.
&nbsp;

00:02:58.480 --> 00:03:03.360
Elsewhere, three young refinery workers are&nbsp;
walking home from work. As they are on their&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:03.360 --> 00:03:09.040
way home, a vampire suddenly drags one of them&nbsp;
into a dark alley. The other two don’t realize&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:09.040 --> 00:03:14.240
what has happened. After a few seconds, the bloody&nbsp;
body of their friend is thrown in front of them.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:14.240 --> 00:03:18.880
The girl runs for her life while the&nbsp;
shocked man stares at his friend’s body.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:18.880 --> 00:03:24.560
As he does, we see the vampires behind him.
Back at the station, Eben is trying to interrogate&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:24.560 --> 00:03:29.520
the strange man but he doesn't speak at all.&nbsp;
Suddenly, all the electronics in the station&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:29.520 --> 00:03:34.800
stop working. Eben tries to call Gus but the&nbsp;
phone doesn't work either. The strange man in&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:34.800 --> 00:03:40.800
the cell tells Eben to hide because ‘they’&nbsp;
are coming. However, Eben dismisses him.
&nbsp;

00:03:40.800 --> 00:03:45.600
Right after, the town’s electricity goes&nbsp;
off. Eben visits Gus’s office to inquire&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:45.600 --> 00:03:51.120
about the electricity. When he reaches there,&nbsp;
he notices a trail of blood on the snow outside.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:51.120 --> 00:03:56.480
He then follows the trail to find Gus’s&nbsp;
head cut off from his body. He immediately&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:56.480 --> 00:04:00.720
gets back to the people of the town and&nbsp;
warns them to stay inside their homes.
 
&nbsp;

00:04:01.280 --> 00:04:06.320
John and his wife Ally are indoors cooking dinner&nbsp;
when suddenly a vampire breaks in through the&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:06.320 --> 00:04:17.280
kitchen’s glass window. The vampire then snatches&nbsp;
Ally and runs away. John tries his best to save&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:17.280 --> 00:04:22.320
his wife and is injured in the process. In&nbsp;
the end, the vampire takes her away.
 
&nbsp;

00:04:22.320 --> 00:04:26.480
Back at the station, the man attacks&nbsp;
Jake. Eben comes in at the right time&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:26.480 --> 00:04:31.120
and shoots his arm. Eben realizes that the&nbsp;
man knows something about Gus’s murderer,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:31.120 --> 00:04:36.320
but the man doesn’t reveal anything. After that,&nbsp;
Eben and Stella set off to look for the murderers&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:36.320 --> 00:04:41.680
themselves. They notice something off in the way&nbsp;
and get out of their car. Stella sees something&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:41.680 --> 00:04:46.720
through her binoculars and tells Eben to get&nbsp;
inside the car. As they drive away, a vampire&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:46.720 --> 00:04:52.000
chases their car and gets on top of it.
Eben shoots the vampire but it doesn't affect him.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:52.000 --> 00:04:57.120
Stella somehow manages to drop him off the vehicle&nbsp;
and they escape. They then get a call from the&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:57.120 --> 00:05:02.800
station. Helen screams for help on the other end.&nbsp;
They drive to the station to see blood splashed&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:02.800 --> 00:05:08.160
everywhere. Jake and Helen are nowhere to be&nbsp;
found but the stranger is still inside the cell.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:08.160 --> 00:05:13.760
When asked what happened, he replies that they&nbsp;
don't want him and asks Eben to kill him.
 
&nbsp;

00:05:13.760 --> 00:05:18.560
Few people gather at the diner and they discuss&nbsp;
that the vampires don’t die when they get shot.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:18.560 --> 00:05:26.480
It is also revealed that they feed off blood. Then&nbsp;
we finally see the faces of vampires. Their leader&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:26.480 --> 00:05:32.320
is named Marlow. He talks in a foreign language&nbsp;
and orders the others to kill everyone. Following&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:32.320 --> 00:05:37.600
the orders, the vampires start killing everyone&nbsp;
who comes in their way. Eben and Stella rush to&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:37.600 --> 00:05:43.120
the diner from earlier to investigate. Jake and&nbsp;
other survivors are there too. However, Helen was&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:43.120 --> 00:05:48.480
killed by one of them. Eben takes everyone to&nbsp;
the attic of a house nearby. As the rest hide,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:48.480 --> 00:05:53.280
he and Stella go out to look for weapons.&nbsp;
But they are attacked by the vampires again.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:53.280 --> 00:05:59.200
They flip Eben’s car and try to drag Stella out.&nbsp;
Right when the vampires are about to kill Stella,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:59.200 --> 00:06:04.880
a bearded man named Brower comes to their aid&nbsp;
and hits the vampires with his bulldozer. 
 
&nbsp;

00:06:04.880 --> 00:06:10.320
Eben and Stella somehow manage to get in Brower's&nbsp;
car and drive away. They drive back to the house&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:10.320 --> 00:06:15.520
and meet the others in the attic. They hear&nbsp;
screams of people being killed outside but do&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:15.520 --> 00:06:21.520
not dare to leave. Eben advises they can go to the&nbsp;
store to get something to eat after a few days.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:21.520 --> 00:06:26.720
They plan to stay in the attic for some time and&nbsp;
move to the utilidor when they get a chance.
&nbsp;

00:06:26.720 --> 00:06:32.800
Meanwhile, Marlow walks up to the stranger in the&nbsp;
cell and thanks him for completing ‘the task’.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:32.800 --> 00:06:38.880
He then snaps his head and kills him. Back in the&nbsp;
attic, they decide to sleep in shifts, ration out&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:38.880 --> 00:06:44.560
their food, and plan their next step later. 
For six days they remain hidden in the attic.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:44.560 --> 00:06:49.920
On the seventh day, they notice a girl outside&nbsp;
screaming for help. The girl is Jake's childhood&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:49.920 --> 00:06:55.360
best friend. Eben realizes that it is a trap&nbsp;
when he sees the vampires on top of the roofs.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:55.360 --> 00:06:59.440
Still, he goes outside to save her&nbsp;
but can only watch her being tortured&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:59.440 --> 00:07:04.480
and eventually killed by the vampires.
As he is about to return, someone calls his name,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:04.480 --> 00:07:09.920
and he notices John hiding in a corner. Eben&nbsp;
tries to help John, but he attacks him instead.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:09.920 --> 00:07:14.560
John has turned into a vampire because his&nbsp;
blood got infected when was trying to save&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:14.560 --> 00:07:19.360
his wife. John tries to bite Eben. Knowing&nbsp;
that there is no other way to save John,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:19.360 --> 00:07:24.480
Eben chops his head off with an ax. 
Eben then goes back to the attic and falls asleep&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:24.480 --> 00:07:30.080
due to exhaustion. There, Wilson’s father, who&nbsp;
has dementia, tries to run away looking for his&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:30.080 --> 00:07:36.080
dead wife. Wilson and Stella calm him down, but&nbsp;
the old man escapes through a window. When Wilson&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:36.080 --> 00:07:41.760
finds out, he immediately runs outside to search&nbsp;
for him, despite Stella’s pleas to stay inside.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:41.760 --> 00:07:46.560
Eben wakes up from all the commotion.
Suddenly, a vampire comes inside the house&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:46.560 --> 00:07:50.400
and Eben and Stella hide from him.
As the vampire is about to get them,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:50.400 --> 00:07:55.280
Wilson’s screams distract him. The vampire&nbsp;
finds Wilson outside the house and eventually&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:55.280 --> 00:07:59.920
kills him. This gives Eben and Stella an&nbsp;
opportunity to go back into the attic.
&nbsp;

00:07:59.920 --> 00:08:06.480
Eighteen days pass in the attic. They have no food&nbsp;
left and everyone’s will to live is weakening.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:06.480 --> 00:08:11.440
They decide that on the very next hailstorm,&nbsp;
they will make a run for the store. Fortunately,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:11.440 --> 00:08:16.720
on the nineteenth day, a snowstorm struck.&nbsp;
They carefully walk towards the store.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:16.720 --> 00:08:21.360
When they reach there, they collect food&nbsp;
and supplies. Just then, they see a little&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:21.360 --> 00:08:27.120
girl sucking the blood out of a dead body. 
The little girl attacks Carter. Brower, Stella,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:27.120 --> 00:08:31.120
and Eben get her away from him and&nbsp;
Jake cuts the little girl’s head off.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:31.120 --> 00:08:35.520
The storm has already stopped when they are&nbsp;
about to leave. Now they are stranded in the&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:35.520 --> 00:08:40.160
store. They decide to go to the utility in&nbsp;
the police station where they can be safe.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:40.160 --> 00:08:44.400
Stella says that the vampires cannot function&nbsp;
in sunlight that is why they have attacked&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:44.400 --> 00:08:49.840
during the polar night. This reminds Jake of a UV&nbsp;
light that his grandmother used to grow plants.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:49.840 --> 00:08:55.600
Eben decides to run to his grandmother’s house to&nbsp;
distract the vampires and use the UV light to kill&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:55.600 --> 00:09:01.600
them while others escape to the utility. He then&nbsp;
runs out screaming with an ax. The vampires hear&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:01.600 --> 00:09:06.640
his screams and run after him. Others run to the&nbsp;
police station to hide in the utility room. 
&nbsp;

00:09:06.640 --> 00:09:11.040
Elsewhere, Eben starts a generator in his&nbsp;
grandmother’s house. He then gets prepared&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:11.040 --> 00:09:16.960
for the vampires with the UV light. The group&nbsp;
of vampires surround the house. Marlow orders&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:16.960 --> 00:09:22.880
his girlfriend Iris, who is also a vampire, to&nbsp;
kill Eben. However, as Iris breaks through the&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:22.880 --> 00:09:28.320
window inside the house, Eben shines the UV&nbsp;
ray on her face, burning it completely.
&nbsp;

00:09:28.320 --> 00:09:33.120
Eben then realizes the vampires are going to&nbsp;
turn the generator off. He makes his escape&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:33.120 --> 00:09:38.720
from the back door. All the vampires go after&nbsp;
him but Marlow stays with a struggling Iris.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:38.720 --> 00:09:40.949
He then kills her to rid her of the pain.
All vampires go after him while Marlow stays&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:40.949 --> 00:09:41.200
with Iris. Seeing Iris struggle to stay&nbsp;
alive, Marlow kills her himself. 
&nbsp;

00:09:41.200 --> 00:09:46.080
Brower then tells Eben that it’s his turn to&nbsp;
distract them now. He gets into a bulldozer and&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:46.080 --> 00:09:51.440
attacks the vampires chasing Eben. After a small&nbsp;
fight, he runs the bulldozer into a building and&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:51.440 --> 00:09:56.960
gets all the vampires to come inside. He then&nbsp;
proceeds to light himself in an explosion. 
&nbsp;

00:09:56.960 --> 00:10:02.000
Fortunately, Eben reaches the police station&nbsp;
safely. There he finds out that Carter was bit&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:02.000 --> 00:10:08.400
by a Vampire and is turning into them. With no&nbsp;
other way out, Carter suggests Eben kill him.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:08.400 --> 00:10:13.920
They both go into a room where Eben cuts his head&nbsp;
off. Only five of them are left but survival looks&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:13.920 --> 00:10:19.200
possible now. It is the twenty-seventh day. They&nbsp;
have enough food to survive for the next few days&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:19.200 --> 00:10:24.640
until the Sun rises again. Suddenly, they notice&nbsp;
someone from the house across trying to send them&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:24.640 --> 00:10:30.560
a signal by flashing lights. Eben assumes someone&nbsp;
is trapped there. He and Stella go to save them.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:30.560 --> 00:10:34.640
They are shocked to see Billy there. 
It is revealed that with no hope left,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:34.640 --> 00:10:40.640
Billy killed his 2 daughters and wife. When he was&nbsp;
about to end his life, his gun stopped working.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:40.640 --> 00:10:45.360
After berating Billy for not saving his family,&nbsp;
they cautiously take him to their hideout&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:45.360 --> 00:10:49.120
but when they reach there, they find&nbsp;
out that everyone else is missing.
&nbsp;

00:10:49.120 --> 00:10:53.840
Assuming they might have gone to the utility, the&nbsp;
trio head there too. When they are halfway there,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:53.840 --> 00:10:58.720
Stella notices a little girl roaming around&nbsp;
the snow. A vampire is about to attack her&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:58.720 --> 00:11:03.600
from behind. Although Eben tells her to ignore&nbsp;
the little girl, Stella can't stop herself&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:11:03.600 --> 00:11:09.040
and rushes to help. The vampire then follows&nbsp;
them. Eben tells Stella and Billy to run away&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:11:09.040 --> 00:11:13.600
with the little girl while he distracts&nbsp;
the vampire. All three of them run away in&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:11:13.600 --> 00:11:19.440
different directions. Eben Somehow makes it to the&nbsp;
utility but finds Stella and Billy missing. 
&nbsp;

00:11:19.440 --> 00:11:24.640
Billy finally reaches the utility but a vampire&nbsp;
gets in as well. He attacks Billy and bites him&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:11:24.640 --> 00:11:30.000
in the neck. After a long struggle, the 2 men&nbsp;
finally kill the vampire by pushing him into the&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:11:30.000 --> 00:11:38.400
meat grinder but in the process, Billy’s hand gets&nbsp;
accidentally ripped off too. Eben then notices&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:11:38.400 --> 00:11:43.120
that Billy has been bitten so he reluctantly&nbsp;
cuts off his friend’s head with an ax.
&nbsp;

00:11:43.680 --> 00:11:48.560
It is the last night of the thirtieth day now.&nbsp;
If they can survive this night, they will be&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:11:48.560 --> 00:11:54.160
free tomorrow. Other people from the group start&nbsp;
celebrating while Eben sees Marlow and his fellow&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:11:54.160 --> 00:12:00.080
vampires gathering through a window. Marlow tells&nbsp;
his fellow vampires that the only reason they&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:12:00.080 --> 00:12:05.280
have been able to survive this long is because&nbsp;
they don’t leave evidence of their work behind.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:12:05.280 --> 00:12:10.480
He then orders them to burn the whole town to the&nbsp;
ground. Just when Eben thinks his wife is dead,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:12:10.480 --> 00:12:13.520
she communicates through a walkie&nbsp;
talkie and informs him that she&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:12:13.520 --> 00:12:17.360
is hiding under a car in the snow. 
Eben promises her that they will watch&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:12:17.360 --> 00:12:21.840
the sunrise together. He notices the car&nbsp;
but the vampires have already broken all&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:12:21.840 --> 00:12:27.840
the oil pipelines of the town. The oil is slowly&nbsp;
filling up the streets and moving towards the car&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:12:27.840 --> 00:12:33.040
Stella and the little girl are hiding under.&nbsp;
Eben realizes there is no way to save her now;&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:12:33.040 --> 00:12:39.440
if she runs they will kill her, if she stays she&nbsp;
will burn. The vampires light the fire and slowly,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:12:39.440 --> 00:12:44.960
it starts to take the whole town under it. With no&nbsp;
options left, he takes some of Billy’s blood out&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:12:44.960 --> 00:12:50.800
through a syringe and injects it into himself.&nbsp;
He knows that this will turn him into a vampire.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:12:50.800 --> 00:12:56.160
His friends look at him turning into one.&nbsp;
He is now a threat to others in the group&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:12:56.160 --> 00:13:01.680
so they decide to kill him. However, his brother&nbsp;
Jake stops them. Eben then says his goodbyes to&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:13:01.680 --> 00:13:07.920
his brother and goes out to fight Marlow. After a&nbsp;
long struggle, Eben finally manages to kill Marlow&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:13:07.920 --> 00:13:13.680
by jamming his hand through Marlow’s head.
The other vampires see their leader dead and run&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:13:13.680 --> 00:13:20.560
away. Finally, the sun rises up and everyone comes&nbsp;
out. Stella and Eben watch the sunrise together.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:13:20.560 --> 00:13:29.520
They share one last kiss. The story ends when the&nbsp;
rays of the sun fall into Eben’s body, he starts&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:13:29.520 --> 00:13:35.040
to burn and eventually dies in Stella’s arms.
